 "category": "transitions",
 "description": {
  "id": "Transisi yang dipilih menurut alasannya, antara dua kartu adegan bertema kertas: robek (ganti lokasi), balik halaman (waktu berlalu), bilah penutup (ganti bab), iris (fokus), geser (kesinambungan), belah robek (makna terputus), atau potong langsung (hentakan). Membungkus modul causalTransitions.",
  "en": "A transition chosen by its cause, between two paper-themed scene cards: torn wipe (new place), page turn (time passes), shutter bars (new chapter), iris (focus), slide (continuity), torn split (broken meaning) or hard cut (impact). Wraps the causalTransitions module."
 },
